        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I highly recommend Axon Extermination.This professional team exceeded my expectations with their expertise and dedication. They thoroughly assessed the situation, explained the process in detail, and effectively handled the issue with skill and precision. Their commitment to customer satisfaction was evident in their attention to detail and follow-up. If you’re looking for reliable and professional extermination services, Axon Extermination is the team to trust.",
        "time": 1731392954,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
