        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I am so relieved that Axon was there when I really needed them. Efficient, reliable and professional service! I had a big problem with ants and bugs getting into my home, very happy to say NO MORE bugs, gone. Thank you Axon, I will definitely recommend you to friends & family 🤗",
        "time": 1719335015,
